</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.584" end="00:15.057"><span begin="00:12.584" end="00:12.798">And </span><span begin="00:12.798" end="00:13.110">set </span><span begin="00:13.110" end="00:13.496">our </span><span begin="00:13.496" end="00:13.913">grief </span><span begin="00:13.913" end="00:15.057">aside</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.504" end="00:19.439"><span begin="00:16.504" end="00:16.727">The </span><span begin="00:16.727" end="00:17.097">papers </span><span begin="00:17.097" end="00:17.934">say </span><span begin="00:17.934" end="00:18.186">it's </span><span begin="00:18.186" end="00:19.439">doomsday</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.152" end="00:22.894"><span begin="00:20.152" end="00:20.391">The </span><span begin="00:20.391" end="00:21.054">button </span><span begin="00:21.054" end="00:21.680">has </span><span begin="00:21.680" end="00:21.919">been </span><span begin="00:21.919" end="00:22.894">pressed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.654" end="00:26.720"><span begin="00:23.654" end="00:23.902">We're </span><span begin="00:23.902" end="00:24.310">gonna </span><span begin="00:24.310" end="00:24.711">nuke </span><span begin="00:24.711" end="00:25.030">each </span><span begin="00:25.030" end="00:25.535">other </span><span begin="00:25.535" end="00:25.887">up </span><span begin="00:25.887" end="00:26.720">boys</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.654" end="00:30.622"><span begin="00:27.654" end="00:27.855">'Til </span><span begin="00:27.855" end="00:28.369">old </span><span begin="00:28.369" end="00:29.046">Satan </span><span begin="00:29.046" end="00:29.494">stands </span><span begin="00:29.494" end="00:30.622">impressed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.713" end="00:38.834"><span begin="00:32.713" end="00:33.006">And </span><span begin="00:33.006" end="00:33.367">here </span><span begin="00:33.367" end="00:33.558">it </span><span begin="00:33.558" end="00:35.479">is </span><span begin="00:35.479" end="00:36.176">our </span><span begin="00:36.366" end="00:36.974">final </span><span begin="00:36.974" end="00:37.358">night </span><span begin="00:37.358" end="00:38.834">alive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.258" end="00:44.378"><span begin="00:39.258" end="00:39.450">As </span><span begin="00:39.450" end="00:39.682">the </span><span begin="00:39.682" end="00:40.697">earth </span><span begin="00:40.697" end="00:41.626">burns </span><span begin="00:41.626" end="00:42.642">to </span><span begin="00:42.642" end="00:43.545">the </span><span begin="00:43.545" end="00:44.378">ground</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.650" end="00:54.366"><span begin="00:44.650" end="00:45.554">Oh </span><span begin="00:45.554" end="00:46.571">boy </span><span begin="00:46.571" end="00:47.553">it's </span><span begin="00:47.553" end="00:50.970">you </span><span begin="00:50.970" end="00:51.142">that </span><span begin="00:51.142" end="00:51.791">I </span><span begin="00:51.791" end="00:52.743">lie </span><span begin="00:52.743" end="00:54.366">with</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.678" end="01:01.623"><span begin="00:54.678" end="00:54.951">As </span><span begin="00:54.951" end="00:55.191">the </span><span begin="00:55.191" end="00:58.870">atom </span><span begin="00:58.870" end="00:59.623">bomb </span><span begin="00:59.623" end="01:00.422">locks </span><span begin="01:00.422" end="01:01.623">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.070" end="01:09.828"><span begin="01:02.070" end="01:02.463">Oh </span><span begin="01:02.463" end="01:02.806">boy </span><span begin="01:02.806" end="01:03.023">it's </span><span begin="01:03.023" end="01:05.572">you </span><span begin="01:05.908" end="01:06.292">I </span><span begin="01:06.292" end="01:06.556">watch </span><span begin="01:06.556" end="01:08.540">TV </span><span begin="01:08.540" end="01:09.828">with</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.131" end="01:19.419"><span begin="01:10.131" end="01:10.604">As </span><span begin="01:10.604" end